 ****************************************************
 * Green-Ampt Model for Calculation of Infiltration *
 * rate & the amount under various scenarios        *
 ****************************************************
 (Source: Applied Hydrology by Chow/Maidement/Mays) 
 ----------------------------------------------------
  
 The input datas are: 
  
 Porosity                               =  4.530000E-001
 Effective porosity                     =  4.120000E-001
 Wetting front soil suction head        =        11.0100000
 Hydrulic conductivity (K)              =         1.0900000
 rainfall intensity    (i) in cm/hr     =         4.0000000
 rainfall duration     (t) in hours     =         3.0000000
 time steps      (delta t) in minutes   =           10
 initial effective saturation           =  4.000000E-001
  
 ---------------------------------------------------
 Case 1: Under Constant Ponding
  
 *-------------------------------------------------*
 * 1st column = t (rainfall duration) in hours     *
 * 2nd column = t (rainfall duration) in minutes   *
 * 3rd column = f (cumulative infiltration) in cm  *
 * 4th column = inf (infiltration rate) in cm/hr   *
 *-------------------------------------------------*
     .17      10       1.1190       3.7410
